<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for taking the time to contact us about your experience at {!Case.Departure_Airport__c}. We strive to accommodate our customers’ needs, but there is a limited amount of storage on board and we need to limit the amount of carry-on in the aircraft cabin. While there has been no change to our cabin baggage policy, we have asked our airport staff and cabin crew to be more vigilant in identifying oversize items, to reduce injuries and assist all customers to find adequate stowage on board.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If within limits permitted onboard add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I was concerned to hear your report that you were forced to check in your cabin bags when you were within your cabin baggage allowance, and would like to apologise on behalf of Qantas. I would like to assure you that your experience was not the service we strive to deliver.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If too many bags add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">There are times when our crew will need to place one bag in the hold if you board with multiple bags and the cabin is very full.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If staff were rude add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I am sorry that our staff were not as courteous as expected and have certainly passed this information on to our Airport Management to take up with the staff working on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}.&nbsp;</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If able to take onboard previously add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I note your comment that you were not stopped with your multiple overweight bags at {!Case.Departure_Airport__c} Airport and apologise if our staff do not seem to be applying our baggage rules consistently. Our Airport Manager in {!Case.Departure_Airport__c} Airport will want to address this matter with the relevant staff members, so thank you for bringing it to our attention.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you again and we look forward to welcoming you on board again soon.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>